new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e653304
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/evidence/electric-steering-response-2026-10-25/review.html
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Electric steering response</title><style>body{font:17px/1.5 system-ui;background:#172129;color:#edf1f3;max-width:1000px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 20px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}th,td{padding:12px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #4b5b63}a{color:#e4e9cf}img{width:100%;height:auto}strong{color:#ffdb75}</style><h1>Electric-4 steering / 2026-10-25</h1><p><strong>95% steering lock: 83.3 → 41.7 ms.</strong> Opposite-steering travel response: 133.3 → 75 ms. Actual direction changes more than twice as far in the first 100 ms across all twelve speed/pedal cases.</p><p>Full steering / 45% pedal, measured velocity paths:</p><table><tr><th>Entry</th><th>Old time</th><th>New time</th><th>Old radius</th><th>New radius</th></tr><tr><td>43.2 km/h</td><td>0.658 s</td><td>0.533 s</td><td>5.96 m</td><td>4.74 m</td></tr><tr><td>86.4 km/h</td><td>0.775 s</td><td>0.608 s</td><td>12.59 m</td><td>9.82 m</td></tr><tr><td>129.6 km/h</td><td>1.050 s</td><td>0.867 s</td><td>24.87 m</td><td>20.52 m</td></tr><tr><td>172.8 km/h</td><td>1.292 s</td><td>1.092 s</td><td>39.01 m</td><td>33.15 m</td></tr></table><p>Same strong acceleration and complete regenerative stop. Established power-corner slip is 16.54° versus 17.58° before. All fifteen regression laps report zero contacts; actual five-lap replay verifies independently.</p><p>Native response86 / turning61 / power19 / replay60 / one-pedal63 / laps6 / Garage-race59+59 and backend72 checks pass. Desktop Mobile is not phone feel acceptance. Reload and matching online verifier rollout remain.</p><a href="native/race.png"><img src="native/race.png" alt="Current actual electric race controls"></a><p><a href="report.json">Evidence and checkpoint report</a></p></html>
